<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - 3COM upped to recommend.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - 3COM upped to recommend.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said analyst Ajay Diwan added 3Com Corp to the recommended list, raising it from market outperform.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 5-1/4 to 61-7/8.</p>
</text>
